    <div class="content-split-image reveal visible">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1442&q=80" width="1442" height="960" alt="Crystal clear Hawaiian waters and coastline" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="content-split-copy reveal visible">
      <div class="chapter">EXPERT PICKS &amp; FLEETS</div>
      <h2>Air Maui &amp; Sunshine Helicopters</h2>
      <h3>C. Air Maui Helicopter Tours: (OUR PICK!)</h3>
      <p>Air Maui Helicopter Tours is renowned for its intimate and personalized experiences. Flying in their A-Star helicopters, you'll have the opportunity to explore Maui's hidden gems and less-traveled areas. Their pilots are passionate about showcasing the island's natural wonders and take pride in creating memorable moments for their passengers. From the cascading waterfalls of Hana to the towering peaks of Haleakala, Air Maui Helicopter Tours offers a diverse range of scenic routes to suit every adventurer. <a href="https://airmaui.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-weight: 600; color: #3f76d3;">Visit Air Maui &rarr;</a></p>
      
      <h3 style="margin-top: 24px;">4. Sunshine Helicopters</h3>
      <p>Sunshine Helicopters has been delighting visitors with their Maui helicopter tours for years. Their fleet of modern helicopters features forward-facing seats, ensuring unobstructed views for everyone on board. Sunshine Helicopters offers a variety of tour options, including doors-on and doors-off experiences, allowing you to customize your adventure based on your preferences. Their friendly and knowledgeable pilots make the journey informative and entertaining, making it a top choice for many travelers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

