      <h2>5. Try flying a plane with Maui Flight Academy!</h2>
      <p>No experience necessary. You will fly in the absolute comfort and safety of the plane with the parachute, the Cirrus SR22 along side the most experienced Certified Flight Instructor in the Cirrus Aircraft fleet, Laurence Balter.</p>
      <p>Whether you want a thrilling aviation adventure or a hands-on introduction to piloting, flying over Maui's coastlines from the cockpit of a Cirrus is an experience unlike any other.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <a href="https://mauiflightacademy.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button" style="background: #171716; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block;">Check out Maui Flight Academy</a>
